   For each valid pair \((n, k)\):
   - Compute \(\gcd(n, k)\)
   - Compute \(\mathop{\text{lcm}}(n, k)\)
   - Calculate the value of \(\frac{\mathop{\text{lcm}}[n,k]}{\gcd(n,k)}\)

4. **Track the Minimum Value**:
   We will keep track of the minimum value found during the iterations.

