\[
\text{result} = 5
\]

This indicates that the smallest possible value of \(\frac{\mathop{\text{lcm}}[n,k]}{\gcd(n,k)}\) under the given constraints is 5.

### Final Answer
Thus, the smallest possible value of \(\frac{\mathop{\text{lcm}}[n,k]}{\gcd(n,k)}\) is:

\[
\boxed{5}
\]
