   \]
   First, we reduce \( 143 \) modulo \( 7 \):
   \[
   143 \div 7 = 20 \quad \text{(remainder } 3\text{)}, \quad \text{so } 143 \equiv 3 \pmod{7}.
   \]
   Thus, we have:
