z_{\text{rotated}} = 1 + i - 3i + 3 = 4 - 2i
\]

### Step 5: Translate Back to the Original Position

Finally, we translate \( z_{\text{rotated}} \) back by adding \( c \):
\[
w = z_{\text{rotated}} + c = (4 - 2i) + (2 - 3i) = 6 - 5i
