\]

#### Step 4: Round to the Nearest Whole Number
Rounding \(106.92^\circ\) to the nearest whole number gives:
\[
\text{Central Angle} \approx 107^\circ
\]

### Final Answer
The central angle for the "45-54 year-old Males" sector is:
\[
\boxed{107}
\]

### Significance of the Result
This result is significant as it provides a visual representation of the proportion of male physicians aged 45-54 in the context of the total number of physicians. Understanding these proportions can help in analyzing workforce demographics in aerospace medicine.
