    # Calculate the volume of the parallelepiped using the formula:
    # Volume = |a . (b x c)|
    # We can use the formula: Volume = ||a|| * ||b|| * ||c|| * sqrt(1 - cos^2(theta1) - cos^2(theta2) - cos^2(theta3) + 2 * cos(theta1) * cos(theta2) * cos(theta3))
    
