To express the speed in a more standard form, we can approximate \( \pi \) as \( 3.141592653589793 \):
\[
12 \pi \approx 12 \times 3.141592653589793 \approx 37.69911184307752
\]

Thus, the speed of the unicycle is:
\[
\boxed{37.69911184307752} \text{ inches per second}
\]
