     \[
     \text{Usable Area} = \text{Usable Length} \times \text{Usable Width} = 9 \, \text{inches} \times 7 \, \text{inches} = 63 \, \text{square inches}
     \]

   - **Step 4: Calculate the area of the margins.**
     \[
     \text{Area of Margins} = \text{Total Area} - \text{Usable Area} = 120 \, \text{square inches} - 63 \, \text{square inches} = 57 \, \text{square inches}
     \]

