\]

#### Step 2: Contribution of Each Digit to Each Place Value
Each digit will appear in each of the five positions (ten-thousands, thousands, hundreds, tens, and units) an equal number of times across all permutations. Since there are 120 total permutations and 5 positions, each digit will appear in each position:

